# Docker Compose Template for SDN Test Topologies
# This template is used by the topology manager to generate docker-compose files.
#
# Template variables:
#   {{.Name}}           - Topology name
#   {{.Description}}    - Topology description
#   {{.Timestamp}}      - Generation timestamp
#   {{.Networks}}       - List of networks
#   {{.Nodes}}          - List of nodes
#
# Usage:
#   The topology.Manager generates docker-compose files from Topology definitions.
#   This template serves as documentation and a reference for manual testing.
